        }
      ],
      "en": "I will make all my mountains a road, and my highways shall be exalted.",
      "ko": "내가 나의 모든 산을 길로 삼고 나의 대로를 돋우리니",
      "source_text_hash": "a2beaac0df302ee69bb99e385584a8c5613fea1218283b092e925dfbcdd78ad8",
      "translation_text_hash": "52b39f86ebfb0f49e45f25103ff848467791370604b511995a01bf2075ac880a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
