        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 49,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, these shall come from afar, and behold, these from the north and from the west, and these from the land of Sinim.”",
      "ko": "혹자는 원방에서, 혹자는 북방과 서방에서, 혹자는 시님 땅에서 오리라",
      "source_text_hash": "34ec44e0f6e96b88e426aae20ce6877f327b65039b3019da1ee449850bc3523a",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ec95ceeb91596c3112360c3501197f20a619e2bfb35d3d140b6d490c3af9ba2",
